          "summary": "Insert new Section 10.9 (Insurance) requiring HDI to carry CGL, E&O, cyber and workers' compensation coverage with certificates on request.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] The Agreement has no insurance covenant even though HDI hosts the Site and has access to our Content, user information and Confidential Information, so we have added a short insurance provision in the General Provisions consistent with our standard requirements (CGL USD 1M/2M, E&O USD 2M, cyber USD 5M, statutory workers' compensation, certificates on request). If those limits are an issue, we can work with E&O of USD 1M and cyber of USD 2M.",
